 Compatibility Testing Service</h3>\n\t\t<div class="padding">\n\t\t\t<p>Control4 offers Compatibility Testing of light fixtures and bulbs sent in by dealers.</p>\n\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t<li>A control4 lighting engineer will test a sample of a light fixture and bulb not in our database. </li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>This process takes approximately 2-3 weeks for turn around.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>A qualified dealer must supply a sample for testing. We will arrange to have your test sample shipped back to you from our testing facility.\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t<p>Please send an email with what fixture you would like to ship in for testing.</p>\n\t\t\t<p>Email us at: <a href="mailto:lightingcompatibility@control4.com">lightingcompatibility@control4.com</a>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>'},LuWU:function(t,e,n){"use strict";n.d(e,"a",(function(){return s}));var r=n("DRwZ");const s=Object(r.a)({selectId:t=>t.sku})},LwJk:function(t,e){t.exports='<div class="padding">\n\t<h1>Search</h1>\n\t<form class="dark" (ngSubmit)="search()">\n\t\t<div class="row no-margin half-padding-bottom">\n\t\t\t<div class="col-md-8 col-sm-5">\n\t\t\t\t<mat-form-field class="no-margin">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input test-id="searchTerm" matInput type="Text" placeholder="Search" class="no-margin" name="searchInput"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t   [(ngModel)]="searchInput" c4Focus>\n\t\t\t\t</mat-form-field>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-md-3 col-sm-5">\n\t\t\t\t<mat-select test-id="selectedCategory" [(ngModel)]="category" name="category" panelClass="show-all" (ngModelChange)="filter()">\n\t\t\t\t\t<mat-option style="height: 40px" value="All" selected>All</mat-option>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mat-option style="height: 40px" *ngFor="let cat of categories" [value]="cat.value"><i class="fw {{cat.icon}}"></i>{{cat.label}}\n\t\t\t\t\t</mat-option>\n\t\t\t\t</mat-select>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class="col-md-1 col-2">\n\t\t\t\t<button test-id="basicSearchClick" type="submit" class="block grey no-margin"><i class="fal fa-search"></i